# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Powers the conversational intake at /start, and (together with
# GEMINI_API_KEY below) the "customize from your own photo" feature in the
# Design Studio — Claude reads the uploaded photo and the visitor's own
# words into one edit instruction; Gemini does the actual image edit.
#
# WITHOUT this key the /start page still works — it falls back to a scripted
# question flow that collects the same brief, draws the same sketch and
# produces the same planning range. What you lose is the ability to
# understand free-form answers ("a little cabin by the lake for guests").
# The photo customizer is unavailable without this key — it needs both.
#
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# On Vercel: Project Settings → Environment Variables.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Powers the AI style images in the chat and Design Studio (Gemini "Nano
# Banana Pro"), and — together with ANTHROPIC_API_KEY above — the photo
# customizer, which edits a visitor's own uploaded photo.
#
# WITHOUT this key everything still works — the chat, the scale sketch, the
# planning range and the email are all unaffected. Only the photoreal style
# image and the photo customizer are skipped, with a short note in their
# place.
#
# Roughly $0.13 per image generated, so a prospect who asks for one render
# costs about 13 cents; the photo customizer costs a Claude call on top of
# that. The image route is throttled to 8 images/minute (4 regenerations per
# visitor); the photo customizer is throttled tighter, 4/minute, since it's
# two paid calls per request.
#
# NOTE: image generation is a PAID model. The key must belong to a Google
# Cloud project with billing enabled — a free-tier key returns 429/403.
#
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. The model is chosen in code, not in AI Studio — the key is not
# bound to a model. Leave blank for Nano Banana Pro (gemini-3-pro-image).
# Set to gemini-3.1-flash-image for the cheaper, faster tier.
GEMINI_IMAGE_MODEL=
